	(text "Phoenix DCT T 2,4 QVGA S RTOUCH (in the UCS 125-87-F-GD-D2,4 lid), datasheet 109921: ST7789V, 4-wire SPI half duplex (SDA is input only), VCC 2.6-3.3 V, FPC FH12-14S-0.5SH."
